{"key":"28e48f1446f50c10","source_file":"Potts Di.json","source_id":13013,"source_url":"concordance-discuss-ppl-ventilare","term":"Discuss","headwords":["Discuss","Discussion"],"latin":["Ventilare","Ventilatio"],"header_pairs":[{"english":["Discuss"],"latin":["Ventilare"]},{"english":["Discussion"],"latin":["Ventilatio"]}],"header_sentences":[],"redirect_xref":null,"works":["AR","CL","SE","TCR"],"contexts":[{"reference":{"work":"AR","section":"294","subsection":"4"},"text":"Wherefore, this was committed to earnest discussion.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"AR","section":"484","subsection":"8"},"text":"The discussion was sharp.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"CL","section":"55","subsection":"3"},"text":"A voice said, Discuss this love.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"CL","section":"55","subsection":"4"},"text":"When they discussed it...","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"CL","section":"132","subsection":"2"},"text":"The arcana of wisdom... which they now discussed and unfolded. CL 132:3.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"CL","section":"133","subsection":null},"text":"They then took up the second subject of discussion...","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"CL","section":"165","subsection":null},"text":"This is why women... are silent in companies of men in which the like things are discussed.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"CL","section":"314","subsection":"end"},"text":"The hands are the ultimates... into which are determined the things discussed and concluded by the mind.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"CL","section":"330","subsection":null},"text":"I once heard a pleasant discussion among men about the female sex...","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"CL","section":"380","subsection":"7"},"text":"We asked why he discussed this.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"TCR","section":"17","subsection":"3"},"text":"They said, We will discuss these things, and after the discussion we will reply.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"TCR","section":"136","subsection":null},"text":"Gymnasia... where the learned discuss various arcana.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"TCR","section":"333","subsection":"2"},"text":"When the speech is about religion, they commit this to discussion, and this proposition and discussion rarely terminates in the affirmative...","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"TCR","section":"459","subsection":null},"text":"The desire seized me... to hear what was being discussed there.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"SE","section":"1728","subsection":null},"text":"They are credulous... not discussing...","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"SE","section":"3474","subsection":null},"text":"Concerning which it was discussed.","comment":null,"footnote":null},{"reference":{"work":"SE","section":"3493","subsection":null},"text":"If they come into discussion, they come into obscurity...","comment":null,"footnote":null}],"slug":"discuss-28e48f","url":"/meta/potts/discuss-28e48f/"}